      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEAVEN ON EARTH (4) was safely held in tougher company last start after drifting back at this track, but prior to that won by a neck at Bendigo (24.26) beating Triple Threat in a T3 Grade 7 on October 14. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Can discover winning form. CUCUZZA (3) turned spotting a big start finishing seventh (23.13) last time in a Mix 6/7 at this track. Expected to give a good account. FORBES HOUDINI (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (22.88) in a T3 Grade 6 at Ballarat. Comes through a solid form race last start. Leading chance. SO TELL ME (7) should be in the finish fresh from a three months break.",
